	<description xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">&lt;b&gt;PREMIUM PRACTICE FOR A PERFECT 5&amp;mdash;WITH THE BESTSELLING AP U.S. HISTORY BOOK ON THE MARKET! Ace the newly-digital AP U.S. History Exam&amp;nbsp;with this&amp;nbsp;comprehensive study guide. Includes 6 practice exams with answer explanations, timed online practice, and thorough content review.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;The Princeton Review Expertise&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Study with prep and practice written entirely by AP educators&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Learn test-taking strategies for multiple-choice and free-response questions, backed by 40+ years of test prep success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Focused, supportive lessons designed and perfected by experts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Everything You Need for a High Score&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;A step-by-step guide on how to better your score with this book&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive review of all topics on the new digital exam&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Detailed coverage of the short-answer and source-based multiple-choice questions&lt;/li&gt;&amp;bull; In-depth guidance on the document-based and long essay questions&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Customize a study plan...</description>
</metadata>
